---
/**
 * Solutions page: “Business Challenges our Solutions Solve” section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-2291de8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="2291de8"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-2f5264b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="2f5264b"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-1db0f90 vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
        data-id="1db0f90"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="heading.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Business Challenges<br /> our Solutions Solve</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-d6412a7 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
        data-id="d6412a7"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <p>Every structured, customised engagement is practical, execution-focused and outcome-driven.</p><p>
            We are flexible – either the whole solution could be opted for to get optimal, comprehensive results, else,
            specific modules with function-focus could be chosen. Each assignment is customised to maximise relevant
            impact.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-15fc39f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="15fc39f"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-2d6df06 vb-position-inline-start vb-view-default vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
        data-id="2d6df06"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
              <span class="vb-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-broadcast-tower"></i> </span>
            </div>
            <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title"><span> Founder dependency and leadership overload </span></h3>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-99ca02c vb-position-inline-start vb-view-default vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
        data-id="99ca02c"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
              <span class="vb-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-calendar-alt"></i> </span>
            </div>
            <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title">
                <span> Organisational inefficiencies affecting growth and profitability </span>
              </h3>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-156980c vb-position-inline-start vb-view-default vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
        data-id="156980c"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
              <span class="vb-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-car-battery"></i> </span>
            </div>
            <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title">
                <span> Weak operational systems, accountability, governance frameworks </span>
              </h3>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-99e4854 vb-position-inline-start vb-view-default vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
        data-id="99e4854"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
              <span class="vb-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher"></i> </span>
            </div>
            <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title">
                <span> Leadership capability or succession planning, team collaboration </span>
              </h3>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-b95895a vb-position-inline-start vb-view-default vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
        data-id="b95895a"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
              <span class="vb-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-certificate"></i> </span>
            </div>
            <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title"><span> GCC setup, operational scaling and sustenance </span></h3>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
